+Hola Marisol,
+
+Thank you for letting us know that both glazed planters from order MP-20108 arrived broken. I'm sorry about the trouble, especially after you went to the effort of reporting it.
+
+Here is where things stand:
+
+- Refund: You asked for a refund of $180.00 for the two planters. Refunds of that size need approval from our billing review team, so I've sent your request to them. I haven't issued the refund myself, and they will follow up with you about it.
+- Store credit: I've added $15.00 in store credit to your account as a thank you for your patience. It will apply automatically at checkout. This is the most I'm able to offer as store credit on a single case, so I wasn't able to add the $30.00 you suggested.
+
+Thank you for your understanding, and for bearing with us while this is sorted out.
+
+Warmly,
+The Marlowe & Pine Crew
